        "2. Square both sides: (x + 1/x)² = k²",
        "3. Expand: x² + 2 + 1/x² = k²",
        "4. Subtract 2: x² + 1/x² = k² − 2",
        "5. Plug in k = 4: 16 − 2 = 14"
