        "2. Plug in all known values; treat Triple as x",
        "3. Compute ΣSingles and ΣPairs separately",
        "4. Solve: x = Total − ΣSingles + ΣPairs",
        "5. Sanity check: x must be ≤ each pairwise overlap"
