        "2. Check if factors are consecutive integers (gap=1) — if yes, guaranteed ÷6",
        "3. If gap ≠ 1, test n=1 (odd) as counterexample for the factor of 2",
        "4. For remaining, test n=1,2 to check divisibility by 3",
